          "short": "Odd.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}f(-x)&=-x-(-x)^3\\\\&=-x+x^3\\\\&=-f(x)\\end{aligned}$$\nOdd.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q1-f",
