          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}f(-x)&=\\sqrt{3-(-x)^2}\\\\&=\\sqrt{3-x^2}\\\\&=f(x)\\end{aligned}$$\nThe domain $[-\\sqrt3,\\sqrt3]$ is symmetric about zero. Even.",
